{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:20.720462+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"I tried on my TPU machine at head and I actually get the \"stride > 1\" behavior in both cases.\r\n\r\nIn general this isn't terribly surprising. Sharding may change the order of operations (it more or less *must* do so), and that may amongst other things change exactly how the TPU uses the matrix units or the order of operations for things like reductions. So you should expect *some* numerical changes from sharding differently, but hopefully they are reasonably small.\r\n\r\nThe precision change here looks consistent with \"different reduction order\" to me. What do you think?","created_at":"2023-07-31T14:25:52Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894#issuecomment-1658477307","id":1658477307,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5i2lr7","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1658477307/reactions"},"updated_at":"2023-07-31T14:25:52Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1658477307","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"@hawkinsp unfortunately it's not small it's compounded the more layer it stacked. when dealing with larger network like stable diffusion VAE the error accumulates up to 1 decimal point. i havent tried to shard the unet yet but i guess it might have the same issue too.","created_at":"2023-07-31T17:50:25Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894#issuecomment-1658880725","id":1658880725,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5i4ILV","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1658880725/reactions"},"updated_at":"2023-07-31T17:50:25Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1658880725","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118566623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lodestone-rock","id":118566623,"login":"lodestone-rock","node_id":"U_kgDOBxEu3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"```\r\n\r\nfrom functools import partial\r\n\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\n\r\nfrom jax.sharding import Mesh, PartitionSpec as P\r\nfrom jax.experimental import mesh_utils\r\nfrom jax.experimental.shard_map import shard_map\r\nfrom jax.sharding import NamedSharding\r\n\r\n# defining mesh dimension\r\nmesh = Mesh(mesh_utils.create_device_mesh((8,1,1,1)), axis_names=('out_channel', 'channel', 'height', 'width'))\r\n\r\n# nchw\r\nimage = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(0), (8, 1280, 8, 8))\r\n# out channel, in channel, dim ,dim\r\nkernel = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(1), (1280, 1280, 3, 3))\r\n# make bias broadcastable\r\nbias = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(2), (1280,))\r\nbias = jnp.expand_dims(a=bias, axis=[0, 2, 3])\r\n\r\n@jax.jit\r\n@partial(\r\n    shard_map, \r\n    mesh=mesh, \r\n    in_specs=(\r\n        P(None, None, None, None), # x is replicated accross device \r\n        P('out_channel', None, None, None), # kernel is sharded accross out dim\r\n        P(None, 'out_channel', None, None), # bias is sharded accross out dim\r\n    ), \r\n    out_specs=P(None, 'out_channel', None, None),\r\n    check_rep=False\r\n)\r\ndef simple_conv(x, kernel, bias):\r\n    y = jax.lax.conv_general_dilated(\r\n        lhs=x,\r\n        rhs=kernel,\r\n        window_strides=(1, 1),\r\n        padding=((1, 1), (1, 1)), # same\r\n        dimension_numbers=[\"NCHW\",\"OIHW\", \"NCHW\"]\r\n    )\r\n    jax.debug.inspect_array_sharding(y, callback=print)\r\n\r\n    return y + bias\r\n\r\n\r\n@jax.jit\r\ndef simple_conv_2(x, kernel, bias):\r\n    y = jax.lax.conv_general_dilated(\r\n        lhs=x,\r\n        rhs=kernel,\r\n        window_strides=(1, 1),\r\n        padding=((1, 1), (1, 1)), # same\r\n        dimension_numbers=[\"NCHW\",\"OIHW\", \"NCHW\"]\r\n    )\r\n    jax.debug.inspect_array_sharding(y, callback=print)\r\n\r\n    return y + bias\r\n\r\ny = simple_conv_2(image, kernel, bias)\r\ny_sharded = simple_conv(image, kernel, bias)\r\n\r\ndeltas = y-y_sharded\r\nprint(\r\n    f\"min: {deltas.min()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"max: {deltas.max()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"std: {deltas.std()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"all close: {jnp.allclose(y,y_sharded)}\",\r\n)\r\n```\r\n@hawkinsp same behaviour with shard map. i think sharding on `jax.lax.conv_general_dilated` is not well supported  because XLA implement img2col optimization under the hood?\r\n\r\nis there's another way to split conv computation so 1/8 of the kernel features is computed on each tpu cores?","created_at":"2023-08-11T08:02:00Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894#issuecomment-1674354459","id":1674354459,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5jzJ8b","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1674354459/reactions"},"updated_at":"2023-08-11T08:04:09Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1674354459","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118566623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lodestone-rock","id":118566623,"login":"lodestone-rock","node_id":"U_kgDOBxEu3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nhi there's a bug when i try perform data&tensor parallelism on `conv_general_dilated`. \r\ni sharded the kernel by the input by batch and the kernel by output channel.\r\nwhen the strides is greater than 1 it creates numerical error compared to unsharded output.\r\n\r\n\r\n```python\r\n\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nfrom jax.experimental import mesh_utils\r\nfrom jax.sharding import PositionalSharding\r\n\r\nsharding = PositionalSharding(mesh_utils.create_device_mesh((8,)))\r\n# nchw\r\nimage = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(0), (8, 1280, 8, 8))\r\n# out channel, in channel, dim ,dim\r\nkernel = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(1), (640, 1280, 3, 3))\r\n# make bias broadcastable\r\nbias = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(2), (640,))\r\nbias = jnp.expand_dims(a=bias, axis=[0, 2, 3])\r\n\r\n# simulate conv FSDP\r\nimage_sharded = jax.device_put(image, sharding.reshape(8,1,1,1)) # shard by batch\r\nkernel_sharded = jax.device_put(kernel, sharding.reshape(8,1,1,1)) # shard by out channel\r\nbias_sharded = jax.device_put(bias, sharding.reshape(1,8,1,1)) # shard by out channel\r\n\r\n# strides 1 ok\r\n@jax.jit\r\ndef simple_conv(x, kernel, bias):\r\n    y = jax.lax.conv_general_dilated(\r\n        lhs=image,\r\n        rhs=kernel,\r\n        window_strides=(1, 1),\r\n        padding=((1, 1), (1, 1)), # same\r\n\r\n    )\r\n    return y + bias\r\n\r\ny = simple_conv(image, kernel, bias)\r\ny_sharded = simple_conv(image_sharded, kernel_sharded, bias_sharded)\r\n\r\ndeltas = y-y_sharded\r\nprint(\r\n    f\"min: {deltas.min()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"max: {deltas.max()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"std: {deltas.std()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"all close: {jnp.allclose(y,y_sharded)}\",\r\n)\r\n\r\n# strides 2 and greater not ok\r\n@jax.jit\r\ndef simple_conv_with_stride(x, kernel, bias):\r\n    y = jax.lax.conv_general_dilated(\r\n        lhs=image,\r\n        rhs=kernel,\r\n        window_strides=(2, 2),\r\n        padding=((1, 1), (1, 1)), # same\r\n\r\n    )\r\n    return y + bias\r\ny = simple_conv_with_stride(image, kernel, bias)\r\ny_sharded = simple_conv_with_stride(image_sharded, kernel_sharded, bias_sharded)\r\n\r\ndeltas = y-y_sharded\r\nprint(\r\n    f\"min: {deltas.min()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"max: {deltas.max()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"std: {deltas.std()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"all close: {jnp.allclose(y,y_sharded)}\",\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\noutput:\r\n```\r\n(stride 1)\r\nmin: 0.0\r\nmax: 0.0\r\nstd: 0.0\r\nall close: True\r\n(stride > 1)\r\nmin: -0.000152587890625\r\nmax: 0.000152587890625\r\nstd: 1.9182461983291432e-05\r\nall close: False\r\n ```\n\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\n\n0.4.13\n\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\n\nTPU\n\n### Additional system info\n\nubuntu 20.04\n\n### NVIDIA GPU info\n\n_No response_","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894/comments","created_at":"2023-07-29T08:25:32Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894","id":1827378719,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"},{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"2A9ECB","default":false,"description":"More info