rl":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"},"commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-07-31T17:50:25Z","event":"mentioned","id":9967092552,"node_id":"MEE_lADOCTkjjc5s65YfzwAAAAJSFcNI","performed_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/9967092552"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"},"commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2023-07-31T17:50:25Z","event":"subscribed","id":9967092570,"node_id":"SE_lADOCTkjjc5s65YfzwAAAAJSFcNa","performed_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/9967092570"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118566623?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/lodestone-rock","id":118566623,"login":"lodestone-rock","node_id":"U_kgDOBxEu3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodestone-rock","user_view_type":"public"},"author_association":"NONE","body":"```\r\n\r\nfrom functools import partial\r\n\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\n\r\nfrom jax.sharding import Mesh, PartitionSpec as P\r\nfrom jax.experimental import mesh_utils\r\nfrom jax.experimental.shard_map import shard_map\r\nfrom jax.sharding import NamedSharding\r\n\r\n# defining mesh dimension\r\nmesh = Mesh(mesh_utils.create_device_mesh((8,1,1,1)), axis_names=('out_channel', 'channel', 'height', 'width'))\r\n\r\n# nchw\r\nimage = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(0), (8, 1280, 8, 8))\r\n# out channel, in channel, dim ,dim\r\nkernel = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(1), (1280, 1280, 3, 3))\r\n# make bias broadcastable\r\nbias = jax.random.normal(jax.random.PRNGKey(2), (1280,))\r\nbias = jnp.expand_dims(a=bias, axis=[0, 2, 3])\r\n\r\n@jax.jit\r\n@partial(\r\n    shard_map, \r\n    mesh=mesh, \r\n    in_specs=(\r\n        P(None, None, None, None), # x is replicated accross device \r\n        P('out_channel', None, None, None), # kernel is sharded accross out dim\r\n        P(None, 'out_channel', None, None), # bias is sharded accross out dim\r\n    ), \r\n    out_specs=P(None, 'out_channel', None, None),\r\n    check_rep=False\r\n)\r\ndef simple_conv(x, kernel, bias):\r\n    y = jax.lax.conv_general_dilated(\r\n        lhs=x,\r\n        rhs=kernel,\r\n        window_strides=(1, 1),\r\n        padding=((1, 1), (1, 1)), # same\r\n        dimension_numbers=[\"NCHW\",\"OIHW\", \"NCHW\"]\r\n    )\r\n    jax.debug.inspect_array_sharding(y, callback=print)\r\n\r\n    return y + bias\r\n\r\n\r\n@jax.jit\r\ndef simple_conv_2(x, kernel, bias):\r\n    y = jax.lax.conv_general_dilated(\r\n        lhs=x,\r\n        rhs=kernel,\r\n        window_strides=(1, 1),\r\n        padding=((1, 1), (1, 1)), # same\r\n        dimension_numbers=[\"NCHW\",\"OIHW\", \"NCHW\"]\r\n    )\r\n    jax.debug.inspect_array_sharding(y, callback=print)\r\n\r\n    return y + bias\r\n\r\ny = simple_conv_2(image, kernel, bias)\r\ny_sharded = simple_conv(image, kernel, bias)\r\n\r\ndeltas = y-y_sharded\r\nprint(\r\n    f\"min: {deltas.min()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"max: {deltas.max()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"std: {deltas.std()}\\n\",\r\n    f\"all close: {jnp.allclose(y,y_sharded)}\",\r\n)\r\n```\r\n@hawkinsp same behaviour with shard map. i think sharding on `jax.lax.conv_general_dilated` is not well supported  because XLA implement img2col optimization under the hood?\r\n\r\nis there's another way to split conv computation so 1/8 of the kernel features is computed on each tpu cores?","created_at":"2023-08-11T08:02:00Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894#issuecomment-1674354459","id":1674354459,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/16894","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5jzJ8b","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1674354459/reactions"},"updated_at":"2023-08-11T08:04:09Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1674354459","user":{"ava